### Global CSS

To customize the Spinner component classes, you can use the `@layer components` directive.
[Learn more](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/adding-custom-styles#adding-component-classes).

```css
@layer components {
  .spinner {
    @apply animate-spin;
  }

  .spinner--accent {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
}
```

